Third-party data
----------------

packages/core/src/detect/model.ts and packages/core/src/detect/fixtures/held-out-*.txt are derived from
FrequencyWords by Hermit Dave (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, commit 525f9b5), which is built
from OpenSubtitles 2018 (http://www.opensubtitles.org/). That content is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
The model holds letter-pair statistics and lists of common short words computed from it; the fixtures hold
word samples used only by the tests. These files are shared under the same CC BY-SA 4.0 license.
Regenerate them with: npm run model -w @layout-fixer/core
